\frac{\phi\mu+\rho}{\phi\mu}
=-1-\frac{\rho}{\phi\mu}\;,
\end{equation*}
so that up to the inessential overall sign which is absorbed in the
convention for the offset the quantity which is normally quoted is

\begin{equation*}
