sign convention written in the statement $\tau_{w}\dot w_{k}=u_{k}
(v_{k}+\rho)$ this is the literal mean–field value
$\kappa_{*}= -(\phi\mu+\rho)/\phi\mu$.  The $-1$ can be absorbed in the
